@startuml SOP-CR-Change-Request-Workflow
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #333333
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F0F0F0
    ParticipantBorderColor #333333
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E6F3FF
}

actor "Customer" as Customer
actor "BA" as BA
actor "PO" as PO
actor "PM" as PM
participant "Frontend UI" as UI
participant "Backend API" as API
participant "AI Engine" as AI
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Customer -> UI: Tạo Change Request (CR)
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /api/change-requests
activate API
API -> DB: Lưu CR, Status: Pending BA
API --> UI: Created
deactivate API
UI --> Customer: Thông báo thành công
deactivate UI

BA -> UI: Xem danh sách CR
activate UI
BA -> UI: Review & Approve CR
UI -> API: POST /api/change-requests/:id/approve (BA)
activate API
API -> DB: Update CR Status: Pending PO
API --> UI: Approved
deactivate API
UI --> BA: Thành công
deactivate UI

PO -> UI: Review & Approve CR (Nghiệp vụ)
activate UI
PO -> UI: Approve CR
UI -> API: POST /api/change-requests/:id/approve (PO)
activate API

API -> DB: Update CR Status: Pending AI Analysis
API -> AI: Gọi SOP-AI-002: Impact Analysis
activate AI
AI --> API: Trả về Impact Report (Affected Tasks, Sprints, Resources)
deactivate AI
API -> DB: Lưu Impact Report
API -> DB: Update CR Status: Pending PM
API --> UI: Approved
deactivate API
UI --> PO: Thành công
deactivate UI

PM -> UI: Xem CR & Impact Report
activate UI
PM -> UI: Review & Approve CR
UI -> API: POST /api/change-requests/:id/approve (PM)
activate API

API -> AI: Gọi SOP-AI-003: Schedule Optimization
activate AI
AI --> API: Trả về Kế hoạch tối ưu (Dependencies, Resource Allocation)
deactivate AI

API -> DB: Cập nhật kế hoạch nháp (Draft Plan)
API --> UI: Trả về Draft Plan để PM xác nhận
deactivate API

PM -> UI: Xác nhận kết quả tối ưu & Apply
UI -> API: POST /api/change-requests/:id/apply
activate API

API -> API: Tạo Version Snapshot (SOP-PM-004)
API -> DB: Apply thay đổi vào Dự án chính
API -> DB: Cập nhật CR Status: Applied
API --> UI: Applied Successfully
deactivate API
UI --> PM: Thông báo thành công
deactivate UI

@enduml
